      ],
      "note": "Same finding as push-to-lynx/1/2. The label counts pending stations that have not been pushed today (sa-main-toolbar.component.ts:153-160). A station is pending whenever its % Adj. differs from what Lynx holds, and % Adj. starts as the suggestion when the user has not edited it (sa-dashboard.component.ts:597-598), so unedited suggestions are counted. Stations already pushed today that still have a pending change are not counted.",
      "question": "",
      "developNote": "",
      "correction": "The button carries the number of stations whose % Adj. differs from what Lynx holds, whether you edited it or left the suggestion, leaving out any already pushed today. Why: pending means \"differs from Lynx\", suggestions included, and the label counts only stations not yet pushed today (sa-main-toolbar.component.ts:153-160)."
    },
